carriers, and any other causes beyond the reasonable control of the applicable Party, shall not constitute a breach of this
Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 1in; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>


