more than fifty percent (50%) of the outstanding shares of voting stock of the Company or other securities of the Company convertible
(after giving effect to such conversion) into more than fifty percent (50%) of the outstanding shares of voting stock of the Company;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.75in"><B>(b)&nbsp;</B>The
