<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.75in"><B>(c)&nbsp;</B>The
business or businesses of the Company for which Executive&rsquo;s services are principally performed are disposed of by the Company pursuant
to a partial or complete liquidation of the Company, a sale of assets or otherwise; or</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">If any of the above three (3) events occur,
then for purposes of this Agreement, the Company or the Company&rsquo;s successor will be considered the &ldquo;<B><I>New Company</I></B>.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B><I>Executive
Management Team</I></B>&rdquo; means the then current officers of XTI Aerospace, Inc., a Nevada corporation.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&ldquo;<B><I>Exempt
Change of Control</I></B>&rdquo; means any transaction in which (i) the New Company is owned, 10% or more, by the Executive Management
Team, or (ii) the Executive Management Team has provided material capital and/or strategic direction to the New Company.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&nbsp;</P>

